0091:     Rule:
0092:     - Tight-crop around the board cluster.
0093:     - For each color layer inside the crop, find its same-color cue outside.
0094:     - Rotate that layer clockwise by (cue pixel count mod 4) × 90°.
0095:     - No outside cue → no rotation.
0096: 
0097:     Key insight: Cue sprite size mod 4 encodes rotation amount for its matching color layer.
